            "source": "conversation:refund-7#1",
            "source_version": "1",
            "authority": "user",
            "trust": "unverified",
            "freshness": "2026-10-15T09:08:00Z",
            "body": "Hi, I bought the Pro plan last month and it is not what I expected. Is my order refundable?",
            "lineage": "verbatim"
          },
          {
            "id": "turn:2",
            "slot": "interaction.history",
            "source": "conversation:refund-7#2",
            "source_version": "1",
            "authority": "untrusted",
            "trust": "unverified",
            "freshness": "2026-10-15T09:08:01Z",
            "body": "I can check that for you. Pro plans are refundable in full within 30 days of purchase. Could you share your order number?",
            "lineage": "generated"
          },
          {
            "id": "turn:3",
            "slot": "interaction.history",
            "source": "conversation:refund-7#3",
            "source_version": "1",
            "authority": "user",
            "trust": "unverified",
            "freshness": "2026-10-15T09:08:02Z",
            "body": "It is order 8821. I paid with my company card, if that matters.",
            "lineage": "verbatim"
          },
          {
            "id": "turn:4",
            "slot": "interaction.history",
            "source": "conversation:refund-7#4",
            "source_version": "1",
            "authority": "untrusted",
            "trust": "unverified",
            "freshness": "2026-10-15T09:08:03Z",
            "body": "Thanks. Order 8821 was placed 12 days ago for 240 EUR, so it is inside the 30-day window. The refund goes back to the card you paid with.",
            "lineage": "generated"
          },
          {
            "id": "turn:5",
            "slot": "interaction.history",
            "source": "conversation:refund-7#5",
            "source_version": "1",
            "authority": "user",
            "trust": "unverified",
            "freshness": "2026-10-15T09:08:04Z",
            "body": "Great. How long does the money take to arrive, and do I lose access to the Pro features straight away?",
            "lineage": "verbatim"
          },
          {
            "id": "turn:6",
            "slot": "interaction.history",
            "source": "conversation:refund-7#6",
            "source_version": "1",
            "authority": "untrusted",
            "trust": "unverified",
            "freshness": "2026-10-15T09:08:05Z",
            "body": "Refunds reach the original card within 5 to 10 business days. Pro features stay active until the refund is issued, then the account returns to the free plan.",
            "lineage": "generated"
          },
          {
            "id": "turn:7",
            "slot": "interaction.history",
            "source": "conversation:refund-7#7",
            "source_version": "1",
            "authority": "user",
            "trust": "unverified",
            "freshness": "2026-10-15T09:08:06Z",
            "body": "Understood. Before you process it, can you confirm there is no cancellation fee for EU customers?",
            "lineage": "verbatim"
          },
          {
            "id": "turn:8",
            "slot": "interaction.history",
            "source": "conversation:refund-7#8",
            "source_version": "1",
            "authority": "untrusted",
            "trust": "unverified",
            "freshness": "2026-10-15T09:08:07Z",
            "body": "There is no cancellation fee for EU customers on a refund inside the 30-day window. I can process it now if you confirm.",
            "lineage": "generated"
          },
          {
            "id": "turn:9",
            "slot": "interaction.query",
            "source": "conversation:refund-7#9",
            "source_version": "1",
            "authority": "user",
            "trust": "unverified",
            "freshness": "2026-10-15T09:08:29Z",
            "body": "Yes, please process the refund for order 8821 now."
